WEBVTT

00:11:27.954 --> 00:11:33.287
So if you think you might allow someone

00:11:33.287 --> 00:11:37.621
to have a child with your DNA
after your death,

00:11:37.621 --> 00:11:40.204
or you don't want them to,

00:11:40.246 --> 00:11:41.412
tell them.

00:11:41.746 --> 00:11:47.246
Write it down, grab a napkin,
put it on a napkin, send a text.

00:11:47.246 --> 00:11:49.746
No matter how strange that text may look.

00:11:49.787 --> 00:11:51.579
(Laughter)

00:11:51.579 --> 00:11:54.746
It happens more often than you think.

00:11:55.746 --> 00:11:59.162
We think more carefully
about organ donation,

00:11:59.162 --> 00:12:01.996
but this is just as important.